    "en": {
      "trackName": "Ski Mini Game: Downhill",
      "description": "Carve your path through the snow in the ultimate downhill arcade experience for Apple Watch.\n\nSki Mini Game brings the thrill of the slopes to your wrist with intuitive mechanics designed specifically for the Digital Crown. Whether you're waiting in line or cooling down after a workout, drop into a quick session of high-speed slalom action.\n\nCORE FEATURES:\n• Precision Control: distinct, smooth steering using the Digital Crown.\n• Instant Action: Launches fast for 30-60 second bursts.\n• Retro Vibes: Classic arcade aesthetics with satisfying physics.\n• Progressive Challenge: Speed increases with each level, how far can you go?\n• Offline Play: No signal? No problem. Play anywhere.\n\nSimple to play, difficult to master. See you on the slopes!",
